    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a renderable 3D mesh. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores mesh geometry, transformation data, material properties, and Direct3D 11 vertex and index buffers.</para>
<para>Supports loading mesh geometry from OBJ files, modifying transformations, configuring materials, and providing geometry and buffer data to the graphics renderer. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
